{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53534","headline":"再酬复言和夸州宅 · 元稹","name":"再酬复言和夸州宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"会稽天下本无俦，任取苏杭作辈流。\n断发仪刑千古学，奔涛（一作「腾」）翻动万人忧。\n石缘类鬼名罗刹，寺爲因坟号虎丘。\n莫着诗章远牵引，由来北郡似南州。\n（见宋孔延之编《会稽掇英总集》卷一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}